@baseUrl = https://localhost:7000
@projectId = 1

### 401 — missing token
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/projects

### 200 — only current owner's projects
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/projects
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv FIREBASE_ID_TOKEN}}

### 201 — create project and return its Location
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/projects
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv FIREBASE_ID_TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Assignment board","description":"Track project tasks"}

### 400 — invalid project name
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/projects
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv FIREBASE_ID_TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":" "}

### 200 for the owner; 404 for another account or a missing project
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/projects/{{projectId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv FIREBASE_ID_TOKEN}}
